<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in New York while Dow off 40 points.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in New York while Dow off 40 points.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in late New York trade, where the Dow Industrials Index was 40.41 points lower at 6,526.77.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia at 7.40 a.m. (1840 GMT).</p>
<p>Company		   Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail   N.Y.    US$17 5/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$32 3/8	 +0 3/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$29 3/4	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	 N.Y.    US$20 7/8	   nil  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$16 5/8	   nil  *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$83 1/2	 -0 5/8 *</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  34		    nil</p>
<p>Brierley	 London  untraded</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  240		   nil</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col London  148 1/2	   -1 1/4</p>
<p>Templeton	London  135		 +2 1/4</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.09		nil</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.58		+2</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$2.75		-15</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
